('127.178.d.10',4,'Which habit best saves time across many similar real estate shoots?','["Shooting without a plan", "Reusing a standard camera and edit preset", "Resetting every setting by hand", "Skipping backups"]'::jsonb,1,'Technical skills.','original'),
('127.178.d.1.A',3,'Using correct grammar in an email quoting a wedding package demonstrates:','["Gardening skills", "Welding skills", "English language arts skills", "Driving skills"]'::jsonb,2,'ELA.','original'),
